-Yo, yo.

00:00:37.369 --> 00:00:39.038
It's always good
to be back, man.

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:41.207
-How have your last five --
-You know, I know Greg, right?

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:42.508
-You know Craig, the drummer?

00:00:42.508 --> 00:00:44.377
-Me and Greg go back like
spinal cords and car seats.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:45.811
-Okay, great.

00:00:45.811 --> 00:00:47.680
Now, you're calling him --
You're calling him Greg --

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.482
You're calling him Greg,
and his name is Craig,

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:50.916
so that makes me doubt --
-I know!

00:00:50.916 --> 00:00:53.286
Everybody else calls him Greg.
-Everybody calls him Greg.

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:56.055
-Same soup. Same soup,
just a different bowl.

00:00:56.055 --> 00:00:57.456
-[ Laughs ] Okay, great.

00:00:57.456 --> 00:00:59.358
Now, quick, you've been gone
for five months.

00:00:59.358 --> 00:01:00.459
I haven't seen you.

00:01:00.459 --> 00:01:01.728
-Everybody's been gone
for five months.

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.295
