-Now we're back.

00:01:03.295 --> 00:01:04.830
What have you been up to?

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.532
-I ended the strike.
Thank you.

00:01:06.532 --> 00:01:08.467
-Yeah. Thank you.
-That was me.

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:09.869
-That was you?
-That was me.

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:11.804
-You ended the strike?
-I ended the strike.

00:01:11.804 --> 00:01:14.374
-How?
-Between the Writers Guild

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:15.775
and the studios.

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:19.412
I went into the meeting with two
of my trusted negotiators --

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:22.715
Craig O. and Bobby Bats.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:25.284
And I told them,
"If you don't end the strike,

00:01:25.284 --> 00:01:26.686
you're going to have
to deal with them."

00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:28.287
-Oh, wow.
-Strike was over.

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:31.491
-Hey, well, thank you.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:34.460
I mean...
-Now we are back. We are back.

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:35.628
-But, you know, I know

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:37.930
