through and through.

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:40.132
A very harrowing week
with the flooding.

00:01:40.132 --> 00:01:42.535
Were you caught up on Friday?
-No, I was on the West Coast.

00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:44.437
I was doing some shows
on the West Coast,

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:46.105
