that's when you get in trouble.

00:02:55.874 --> 00:02:58.211
Do you worry about stuff
like identity theft?

00:02:58.211 --> 00:02:59.412
Is that a thing...?
-I ain't worried about

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:01.513
