somebody steals it

00:03:15.428 --> 00:03:17.529
so they could give instruction
on how to deal with the fina--

00:03:17.529 --> 00:03:19.198
Yeah, I see.
-Yeah.

00:03:19.198 --> 00:03:21.300
-What about, you know, this is
a big issue in the strike

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.302
